[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4919959024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121083#issuecomment-4919959024","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121083","id":4919959024,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJUCd8A","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T23:03:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T23:03:46Z","body":"The main thread restriction was enforced to ensure types are constructed as part of the critical path. It is intentionally restrictive because if types are constructed off the critical path, it could indicate an instability in access and potential multithreaded bugs down the line. \n\nYou linked a particular piece of code as explanation. Could you elaborate on how it leads to types being constructed off the main thread, and which those might be?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4919959024/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4921803269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121083#issuecomment-4921803269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121083","id":4921803269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJVzCBQ","user":{"login":"0x0ACB","id":11277588,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjc3NTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11277588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB","html_url":"https://github.com/0x0ACB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x0ACB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-09T05:17:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T05:25:52Z","body":"Nothing is actually constructed off the main thread. As I mentioned the issue is that `Main::setup` will first set the current thread as the main thread, but crucially at the end of `Main::setup` godot will call `Thread::release_main_thread();` which will remove the main thread marker from the current thread again. libgodot will only then initalize the GDExtension which will also call https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e17f949f934246f8951f1a926f22b22514698cb3/core/extension/gdextension_manager.cpp#L44 and since core types have already been initialized in `Main::setup` this will then call the init func of your GDExtension with `GDEXTENSION_INITIALIZATION_CORE`. Since  `Main::setup` has removed the main thread marker from the thread `ERR_FAIL_COND(!Thread::is_main_thread());` will fail for every thread and even though we are actually still on the same thread that called `Main::setup` any signal or constant registration will fail.\n\nThe issue is not that types are constructed off the main thread, but that there is no main thread due to the initialization order of the engine.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4921803269/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4934625905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121083#issuecomment-4934625905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121083","id":4934625905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJiBqcQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","sit